/**
 * Structured payload that depends on `postType`. See `FeedPost.metadata`
for the per-type shape (e.g. `tournament_win` carries `challengeId`,
`challengeTitle`, `bracketSize`, `boostedXp`, `boostedCoins`;
`evolution_reveal` carries `hatchlingId`, `hatchlingName`,
`fromStage`, `toStage`, optional stage/realm/image fields, and
`statDeltas`; `artifact_unlock` carries `artifactId`,
`artifactName`, `artifactRarity`, `artifactLore`). The server
validates this object against a per-postType Zod schema at
write time — payloads with missing required keys or wrong
types are rejected with `400`. For `tournament_win`, the
server also verifies the authenticated player actually
placed first (rank=1) in the referenced challenge. For
`evolution_reveal`, the server enforces creature ownership
and that `toStage > fromStage`.

 */
